      <h1 class="page__title">FAQ</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="acc">
      <details open><summary>When does the next drop go live?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">FW26 // Lake Effect drops in three waves — Oct 16, Nov 6, and Nov 20 @ 9AM PT. Newsletter subscribers get early access links.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How do drops work?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">Small batches, numbered drops. When it's gone it's gone — restocks only happen on proven favorites.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Where does the 10% go?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">Straight to rescue-dog partner organizations — shelter fees, vet bills, foster supplies, transport runs. Totals are shared in the newsletter.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How do hats fit?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">One size with adjustable snapback — fits 55–62cm. Mid-profile 5-panel crown. Full chart on the size guide.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How do tees fit?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">Boxy, true to size. Between sizes and want a cleaner fit? Size down. Measurements on the size guide.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Do you ship internationally?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">Yes — 7–14 business days, cost calculated at checkout. Duties are the buyer's responsibility.</div></details>
      <details><summary>What's the return policy?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">30 days, unworn and unwashed, no questions asked. Details on the shipping &amp; returns page.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Can my dog be on the site?<svg viewBox="0 0 12 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="m1 1.5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></summary><div class="acc-body">Yes. Tag #StrayDogPack — the community page is all customers and their rescues.</div></details>
